# Generated by forge build from forge/seed and the checkout's fixes. Do not edit: see docs/FORGE.md, "Fixing a generated guide".
# Un'Goro Crater and Ironforge, Alliance 48 to ~52 (consensus visits 56 and 57; 58 handed off).
# Flow: Thelsamar -> Menethil Harbor -> the boat to Theramore -> Gadgetzan -> down the ramp into the crater ->
# Torwa Pathfinder and the wrecked raft by the entrance -> Marshal's Refuge (flight path, hub) -> loop 1: Fire
# Plume Ridge and the eastern jungle for the crystals and petals -> A-Me 01 and the grind to 50 on Ironstone
# Plateau -> Marshal's Refuge -> loop 2: the pylons with the Pterrordax, the Diemetradons, Torwa, the Gorishi
# hive, the dinosaur bones and the expedition's equipment -> Marshal's Refuge -> the gorilla pelts on Ironstone
# Plateau -> Ringo on Fire Plume Ridge -> his escort back to the refuge -> the Centipaar grind in western
# Tanaris -> Torwa -> Lar'korwi -> Torwa -> U'cha on the gorilla plateau -> down the west side to Krakle -> the
# Fire Plume vents -> Krakle -> Torwa -> hearth Thelsamar -> Ironforge (bind, training but for Druids, errands).
# Forever's 30-60 content (Riverglades, Shen'dralas, Mount Hyjal, the rest of the Wetlands expansion) is not in
# the data yet: this guide follows Era + known Forever quests.
# Optional extras: Zul'Farrak instead of the long grind to 50 (a group run; it sits just north of Gadgetzan);
# the Sunken Temple instead of the long grind to 51 (a group gets there faster).
# Order changes against the simulator, same quest set:
# - Torwa's first two quests (4290, 4291) and the raft (3844) are done on arrival: the ramp ends beside them.
# - The export's grind to 50 on Ironstone Plateau is moved from after loop 2 to the end of loop 1 (you arrive
#   about a level behind the export): Beware of Pterrordax and The Apes of Un'Goro (4501, 4289, both level
#   55) are red below 50, and at 50 they fit into loop 2 with no extra ride. 4501 is done with Shizzle's
#   scales on the same Pterrordax, so its turn-in moves up to loop 2; 4289 is taken from Torwa on loop 2's way
#   past, its pelts are collected after loop 2 and handed in at the first Torwa stop after the grind to 51
#   (U'cha needs them turned in).
# - The three pylon turn-ins are made together with 4321 at the end of loop 2.
# - A Little Help From My Friends (4491) starts Ringo's escort the moment it is accepted, so the escort and the
#   turn-in follow at once instead of after the level 51 grind.
# - Local order: Lar'korwi is close to Torwa, so his head goes in before U'cha; the crater is then crossed once
#   (north-east, west, south-east back to Torwa).
# - Local order: on the return from loop 2, Shizzle (4503) and Spraggle
#   (4501) at the refuge's entrance come first, then the Marshals and Spark.
# - Williden's Journal (3884) is optional: A Mangled Journal is a rare drop from the crater's beasts.
# - Export visit 58 (Rut'theran Village at 51.4: 3022, 3661, 2939, 2940) is handed in by 40-50/05, which already
#   passes Rut'theran at 47, so there is no Teldrassil trip here. The Talrendis Point flight path (listed by the
#   export with that stop) opens in the next guide, where you reach Azshara.
# Carried on: The New Springs (980) and It's a Secret to Everybody (3908) for Winterspring; A Visit to Gregan (4142)
# for Feralas; A Little Slime Goes a Long Way (4512) for Felwood; The Smoldering Ruins of Thaurissan (3701) for the
# Burning Steppes; Arcane Runes (3449) for Azshara.
# Class quests: Priests take Cenarion Aid (8254) from High Priest Rohan in the Mystic Ward for Ogtinc in Azshara,
# the next guide's first stop.
# Left out (not in the route): Chasing A-Me 01's later parts (4244, 4245: an Engineering item), the northern
# pylon's crystal buffs (4381-4386: no experience), Dadanga is Hungry! (5150, repeatable), Super Sticky and the
# Gadgetzan silithid quests (4504, 4493, 4496); accepted by the export but never turned in on its route: The
# Brassbolts Brothers (2769), Tabetha's Task (2861), A Call to Arms: The Plaguelands! (5090) and The Borrower
# (2941).
# Not restored: Reclaimed Treasures (1360): Krom Stoutarm's chest stands in the North Common Hall inside the
# Uldaman dungeon, so it is dungeon work.
guide forever/alliance/40-50/07-un-goro-crater
title Un'Goro Crater & Ironforge
faction Alliance
levels 48-52
zone Un'Goro Crater
next forever/alliance/50-60/01-burning-steppes

# v1 improved: order from the simulator's search (Human Alliance, 2000000 tries, seeded with v1's order;
# 125.7 h -> 117.5 h to 60 in the model), written by polestar apply-route.
# The notes above describe v1's order; the steps below are the improved one.

step Un'Goro Crater
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  goto 71.6,76.0 "Un'Goro Crater"

step Torwa Pathfinder
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Ride west out of Gadgetzan to the long ramp down into Un'Goro Crater. Torwa camps at the foot of the ramp, in the south-east corner of the crater.
  accept 4290

step Fresh Threshadon Carcass
  tip The dead Threshadon lies by the water north of Torwa.
  collect 11504 quest 4290            -- Piece of Threshadon Carcass

step Torwa Pathfinder
  turnin 4290
  accept 4291

step Lar'korwi Mates and the raft
  tip The Lar'korwi Mates prowl the jungle west of Torwa. The wrecked raft lies on the shore of the lake there; the small pack sits in the water beside it. Keep the compass, map and key for Linken. Any beast in the crater may drop A Mangled Journal: right-click it.
  collect 11509 quest 4291            -- Ravasaur Pheromone Gland
  accept 3844                         -- A Wrecked Raft
  turnin 3844                         -- A Small Pack, underwater
  accept 3845
  collect 11104 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11105 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11106 quest 3845 @63.1,69.1
  collect 11116 x1 optional           -- A Mangled Journal
  accept 3884 optional

step Karna Remtravel
  tip Karna stands just outside the refuge.
  accept 4243

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Marshal's Refuge

step Marshal's Refuge
  tip Ride north along the east side of the crater to Marshal's Refuge, the camp in the caves of the northern cliff. Give the elite devilsaurs and stegodons a wide berth. Pick up every Power Crystal and Un'Goro Dirt Pile you pass from here on.
  accept 4141                         -- Muigin
  turnin 3845                         -- Linken
  accept 3908                         -- Ends with Donova Snowden in Winterspring: keep it
  accept 3883                         -- Hol'anyee Marshal
  accept 3881
  getfp "Marshal's Refuge"            -- Gryfe
  turnin 3884 optional                -- Williden Marshal
  accept 4284                         -- J.D. Collie, at the back of the cave; below ground

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 1: the middle and the east

step Un'Goro Crater: kill these as you meet them
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Ride south to Fire Plume Ridge in the middle of the crater, then east into the eastern jungle. Crystal clusters stand all over the crater, many of them around Fire Plume Ridge: take a few extra of each colour. Bloodpetal Lashers and Threshers drop the petals; the expedition's Crate of Foodstuffs sits at an abandoned camp in the eastern jungle.
  collect 11184 quest 4284            -- Blue Power Crystal
  collect 11185 quest 4284            -- Green Power Crystal
  collect 11186 quest 4284            -- Red Power Crystal
  collect 11188 quest 4284            -- Yellow Power Crystal
  collect 11316 quest 4141            -- Bloodpetal

step Marshal's Refuge
  tip Ride west back to the refuge.
  turnin 4284                         -- J.D. Collie, below ground
  accept 4285
  accept 4287
  accept 4288
  accept 3882                         -- Spark Nilminer
  turnin 4141                         -- Muigin
  accept 4142                         -- For Gregan Brewspewer in Feralas: keep it
  accept 4503                         -- Shizzle, at the refuge entrance

step Webbed Diemetradon Scale on the way
  along until q4503
  collect 11830 quest 4503

step Level 49.16
  when level<49.16
  tip Top up here to level 49.16 before the hand-ins at Un'Goro Crater: they take you to level 50.
  goto 57.5,10.5 map 1449 "Pterrordax"
  level 49.16                          -- grind on Pterrordax

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Loop 2: the pylons

step Northern Pylon
  label q4503
  tip The pylon stands on the slope east of the refuge. Pterrordax circle the slopes around it: they count for Spraggle and drop Shizzle's scales.
  goto 56.5,12.5 "Northern Crystal Pylon"
  complete 4285
  collect 11831 quest 4503            -- Webbed Pterrordax Scale
  collect 11830 quest 4503
  collect 11830 quest 4503

step A-Me 01
  tip Ride north to Ironstone Plateau, where the robot stands among the gorillas. Stay out of the deep cave there.
  turnin 4243                         -- Below ground

step Level 49.32
  when level<49.32
  tip Top up here to level 49.32 before the hand-ins at Marshal's Refuge: they take you to level 50.
  goto 57.0,10.2 map 1449 "Pterrordax"
  level 49.32                          -- grind on Pterrordax

step Crate of Foodstuffs
  collect 11113 quest 3881            -- Crate of Foodstuffs
  level 49.36                          -- grind on Pterrordax

step The Gorishi hive
  tip Ride west from Torwa: the silithid hive fills the south of the crater. Use the Scraping Vial on a hatchery, a chamber with hanging larvae. Gorishi wasps and workers drop Un'Goro Soil; Pterrordax nest on the southern cliffs if you still need kills.
  tip Careful: Gorishi silithids are level 51-54 and cast Silithid Pox or Tunneler Acid in melee; Gorishi Workers have a 50% chance to call for help within 25 yd once they fall below 45% health.
  collect 11018 quest 3764            -- Un'Goro Soil

step Eastern Pylon
  tip The pylon stands on the eastern cliffs.
  goto 77.2,50.0 "Eastern Crystal Pylon"
  complete 4287

step Level 49.41
  when level<49.41
  tip Top up here to level 49.41 before the hand-ins at Marshal's Refuge: they take you to level 50.
  goto 66.5,66.5 map 1449 "Lar'korwi Mate"
  level 49.41                          -- grind on Lar'korwi Mate

step The Slithering Scar
  use 11132 @48.7,85.3 map 1449
  collect 11131 quest 3883            -- Hive Wall Sample
  level 49.45                          -- grind on Lar'korwi Mate

step Bones and equipment
  tip Dinosaur Bones lie on the ground in the south-west, among the stegodons: those are elite, pick the bones up around them and take the rest from Diemetradons. The expedition's Research Equipment lies in the south-west jungle.
  collect 11112 quest 3881            -- Research Equipment
  level 49.64                          -- grind on Elder Diemetradon

step Western Pylon
  tip The pylon stands on the western cliffs. Frenzied Pterrordax fly over the whole west side.
  goto 23.9,59.2 "Western Crystal Pylon"
  complete 4288

step Un'Goro Crater: kill these as you meet them
  zone Un'Goro Crater
  tip Ride south down the east side. Young Diemetradons graze the eastern jungle and Fledgling Pterrordax fly near the eastern cliffs; both drop Shizzle's scales.
  collect 11114 quest 3882            -- Dinosaur Bone
  collect 11830 quest 4503            -- Webbed Diemetradon Scale

step Marshal's Refuge
  tip Ride north along the western jungle back to the refuge.
  turnin 4503                         -- Shizzle, at the refuge's entrance
  turnin 3882                         -- Spark Nilminer
  turnin 3883                         -- Hol'anyee Marshal
  turnin 3881                         -- Williden Marshal
  turnin 4285                         -- J.D. Collie, below ground
  turnin 4287
  turnin 4288
  accept 4321
  turnin 4321

step Hearth to Stoutlager Inn
  when bound "Stoutlager Inn"
  hearth "Stoutlager Inn"

step To Stoutlager Inn
  when !bound "Stoutlager Inn"
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 35.5,48.4 "Stoutlager Inn"

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- Ironforge

step Fly to Ironforge
  zone Loch Modan
  goto 33.9,50.8 "Thelsamar flight master"
  fly "Ironforge"
  zone Ironforge

step Hall of Explorers
  accept 3448                         -- Historian Karnik
  turnin 3368                         -- Curator Thorius
  accept 4512                         -- Laris Geardawdle: the oozes are in Felwood, keep it

step Royal Historian Archesonus
  tip Archesonus stands beside King Magni in the High Seat.
  accept 3702
  complete 3702
  turnin 3702
  accept 3701                         -- The relics are in the Burning Steppes: keep it

step Mystic Ward
  turnin 3448                         -- Tymor
  accept 3449                         -- Four rune rubbings in Azshara: keep it
  accept 3450
  accept 8254 npc 11406 only Priest   -- High Priest Rohan: for Ogtinc in Azshara, keep it

step Bind and train
  only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock
  train class only Warrior,Paladin,Hunter,Rogue,Priest,Shaman,Mage,Warlock

step Xiggs Fuselighter
  tip Xiggs waits in the Military Ward.
  turnin 3450
  accept 3451
  turnin 3451

step Fly to Menethil Harbor
  zone Ironforge
  goto 55.9,47.9 "Ironforge flight master"
  fly "Menethil Harbor"

step Boat to Auberdine
  zone Wetlands
  goto 4.5,56.7 "Boat to Auberdine"

step Fly to Astranaar
  zone Darkshore
  goto 36.4,45.6 "Auberdine flight master"
  fly "Astranaar"

step Level 50.4
  zone Azshara
  when level<50.4
  tip Top up here to level 50.4 before the hand-ins at Talrendis Point: they take you to level 51.
  goto 17.0,69.4 map 1447 "Highborne Apparition"
  level 50.4                          -- grind on Highborne Apparition